chable/papers/54016763/54016763-0016.xml", "clearText": "<html><head></head><body><div class=\"indent continuation wasptag\"> Legal order or process of the Municipal Court Wherein he she<aside class=\"popup-wrapper\" id=\"9649749895747653121\"><a href=\"#9649749895747653121\" class=\"new-scribe-note staticPopup\" title=\"New Scribe\" name=\"trans12\"><img src=\"//cdn.churchofjesuschrist.org/ch/jsp/images/icn-new-scribe-16.png\" alt=\"Indicates a change in handwriting to a different scribe.\"></a><div class=\"popup-content\"><div class=\"note-data editorial-footnote\" isnote=\"Y\"><p class=\"bottom_0\">Insertion in the handwriting of first unidentified scribe.</p><hr></div></div></aside> or they are Bound by <aside class=\"popup-wrapper\" id=\"13774958622585722661\"><a href=\"#13774958622585722661\" class=\"reference staticPopup\" ro=\"x33313\" topic=\"x33313\" title=\"Recognizance\">recognizance</a><div class=\"popup-content\"><div class=\"note-data\" isnote=\"Y\" isnonsearchable=\"Y\"><input type=\"hidden\" value=\"Recognizance\"><p>“An obligation of record . . . to do some act required by law,” such as “to keep the peace, to pay a debt, or the like.” Recognizance is “somewhat like an ordinary bond, the difference being that a bond is the creation of a fresh debt, or obligation de novo...</p><a class=\"more\" href=\"/topic/recognizance\">View Glossary</a></div></div></aside> to appear; the following shall not be deemed to be the same Cause, “First” If after a discharge for defect of prooff or any material defect in the Commitment in a Criminal Case the prisoner or prisoners should be again arested upon sufficient proof and committed by Legal process, for the same offence, “Second” if in a Civil Suit the <aside class=\"popup-wrapper\" id=\"12134304208829013859\"><a href=\"#12134304208829013859\" class=\"new-scribe-note staticPopup\" title=\"New Scribe\" name=\"trans13\"><img src=\"//cdn.churchofjesuschrist.org/ch/jsp/images/icn-new-scribe-16.png\" alt=\"Indicates a change in handwriting to a different scribe.\"></a><div class=\"popup-content\"><div class=\"note-data editorial-footnote\" isnote=\"Y\"><p class=\"bottom_0\">Insertion in the handwriting of first unidentified scribe.</p><hr></div></div></aside> party or<aside class=\"popup-wrapper\" id=\"2904506817647980528\"><a href=\"#2904506817647980528\" class=\"new-scribe-note staticPopup\" title=\"New Scribe\" name=\"trans14\"><img src=\"//cdn.churchofjesuschrist.org/ch/jsp/images/icn-new-scribe-16.png\" alt=\"Indicates a change in handwriting to a different scribe.\"></a><div class=\"popup-content\"><div class=\"note-data editorial-footnote\" isnote=\"Y\"><p class=\"bottom_0\">Insertion in the handwriting of second unidentified scribe.</p><hr></div></div></aside> parties have been discharged for any illegality in the Judgment or<aside class=\"popup-wrapper\" id=\"12769329267170899448\"><a href=\"#12769329267170899448\" class=\"new-scribe-note staticPopup\" title=\"New Scribe\" name=\"trans15\"><img src=\"//cdn.churchofjesuschrist.org/ch/jsp/images/icn-new-scribe-16.png\" alt=\"Indicates a change in handwriting to a different scribe.\"></a><div class=\"popup-content\"><div class=\"note-data editorial-footnote\" isnote=\"Y\"><p class=\"bottom_0\">Insertion in the handwriting of first unidentified scribe.</p><hr></div></div></aside> process and are<aside class=\"popup-wrapper\" id=\"13345968191833389867\"><a href=\"#13345968191833389867\" class=\"new-scribe-note staticPopup\" title=\"New Scribe\" name=\"trans16\"><img src=\"//cdn.churchofjesuschrist.org/ch/jsp/images/icn-new-scribe-16.png\" alt=\"Indicates a change in handwriting to a different scribe.\"></a><div class=\"popup-content\"><div class=\"note-data editorial-footnote\" isnote=\"Y\"><p class=\"bottom_0\">Insertion probably in the handwriting of second unidentified scribe. Curlicues were used to finish the rest of this line, presumably to foreclose the possibility of adding further text.</p><hr></div></div></aside> afterwards imprisoned by Legal process, for the same cause of action “Third”, Generally whenever the discharge has been ordered on accounty of the nonobservance of any of the forms required by Law the party or parties may be a second time imprisoned if the cause be Legal and the forms required by Law observed. [p. 12]</div></body></html>", "expandedText": "<html><head></head><body><div class=\"indent continuation wasptag\"> Legal order or process of the Municipal Court Wherein <span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span>he &lt;​she​&gt;<aside class=\"popup-wrapper\" id=\"9125344557480273983\"><a href=\"#9125344557480273983\" class=\"new-scribe-note staticPopup\" title=\"New Scribe\" name=\"trans12\"><img src=\"//cdn.churchofjesuschrist.org/ch/jsp/images/icn-new-scribe-16.png\" alt=\"Indicates a change in handwriting to a different scribe.\"></a><div class=\"popup-content\"><div class=\"note-data editorial-footnote\" isnote=\"Y\"><p class=\"bottom_0\">Insertion in the handwriting of first unidentified scribe.</p><hr></div></div></aside> or they <span class=\"deleted\">or</span> &lt;​are​&gt; Bound by <aside class=\"popup-wrapper\" id=\"14792600358732688298\"><a href=\"#14792600358732688298\" class=\"reference staticPopup\" ro=\"x33313\" topic=\"x33313\" title=\"Recognizance\">recognizance</a><div class=\"popup-content\"><div class=\"note-data\" isnote=\"Y\" isnonsearchable=\"Y\"><input type=\"hidden\" value=\"Recognizance\"><p>“An obligation of record . . . to do some act required by law,” such as “to keep the peace, to pay a debt, or the like.” Recognizance is “somewhat like an ordinary bond, the difference being that a bond is the creation of a fresh debt, or obligation de novo...</p><a class=\"more\" href=\"/topic/recognizance\">View Glossary</a></div></div></aside> to appear; <span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span>the following shall not be deemed to be the same <span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://